{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"aae12c676fc609ea","type":"text","text":"ISP(Image Signal Processor)","x":1662,"y":994,"width":278,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"9b906a4a0290c6a0","type":"text","text":" YUV/RGB","x":1699,"y":2420,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d34afcefe153d630","type":"text","text":" 编码/显示","x":1727,"y":2600,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"65a2bb6ce0f42731","type":"text","text":" 3A (`AE` 自动曝光、`AWB` 自动白平衡、`AF` 自动对焦)","x":1727,"y":2240,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"5c59bb90897298ea","type":"text","text":" RAW","x":1631,"y":179,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fb6caa91c35da8ee","type":"text","text":"[相机 - 树莓派文档](https://www.raspberrypi.com/documentation/accessories/camera.html#camera-module-3)","x":1020,"y":920,"width":200,"height":50},
		{"id":"9f5cc48f67197403","type":"text","text":"Sensor","x":1646,"y":-400,"width":221,"height":71,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f15789ebd644c156","type":"text","text":"ISP 常见模块的大地图","x":2320,"y":1141,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"87868f9029fa17d4","type":"text","text":"AE 自动曝光\nAGC 增益控制","x":3620,"y":842,"width":378,"height":79},
		{"id":"6ace22140dbf6c8c","type":"text","text":"先调静态基础项","x":3200,"y":502,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"15042d722639762c","type":"text","text":"再调颜色还原链","x":3200,"y":673,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"11702f44e1d0f89b","type":"text","text":"再调曝光链","x":3200,"y":852,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2dda7f581be6feea","type":"text","text":"再调细节和噪声","x":3200,"y":1011,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4aaec67cc7576179","type":"text","text":"再看视频动态表现","x":3200,"y":1171,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9e90c267f370a1d1","type":"text","text":"2D/3D NR降噪和细节损失的平衡\nSharpen 锐化\nWDR/HDR 宽动态","x":3608,"y":965,"width":378,"height":106},
		{"id":"042e1d386d4e9b19","type":"text","text":"静态图好看，不代表视频好：\nAE 收敛速度\nAWB 切换稳定性\n明暗切换闪变\n运动拖影\n夜景噪声 pumping","x":3575,"y":1089,"width":443,"height":164},
		{"id":"15a16215f1dbf333","type":"text","text":"AWB 自动白平衡\nCCM 颜色校正矩阵\nGamma让画面层次看起来舒服，不死黑不死白","x":3594,"y":638,"width":560,"height":131},
		{"id":"16d835cd295fdc89","type":"text","text":"先点亮并确认 RAW 正常","x":3200,"y":328,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"80f694dc2c85647c","type":"text","text":"BLC / 黑电平`Black Level`\nDPC / 坏点修正\nLSC / Lens Shading暗角\nDemosaic 去马赛克","x":3631,"y":463,"width":367,"height":139},
		{"id":"a5ecbaab3713df30","type":"text","text":"Sensor 上电、I2C 通\n时钟、MIPI/DVP、分辨率、fps 正常\n画面无花屏、无丢帧、无错行、无异常噪点\n能抓到 RAW，且 Bayer pattern、bit depth、黑电平基本正确","x":3608,"y":288,"width":522,"height":140},
		{"id":"eb3085366f58963a","type":"text","text":"- 作用：把“真正的黑”校准好，是整条图像链路的地基。\n- 不对会怎样：整张图发灰、暗部不干净、颜色看起来发飘。\n- 新手先看什么：盖住镜头看黑场，观察各通道偏移是否一致。\n- 记法：先把“零点”摆正，再谈后面的亮度和颜色。","x":4526,"y":288,"width":521,"height":120},
		{"id":"6b3504f017890e8d","type":"text","text":"**2. DPC 坏点修正**\n\n- 作用：修掉传感器里的坏点、亮点、暗点。\n- 不对会怎样：画面里有固定白点/黑点，低照和长曝光时更明显。\n- 新手先看什么：暗场、长曝光、高温场景最容易暴露问题。\n- 记法：这是“补漏洞”，不是画质美化。","x":4520,"y":453,"width":533,"height":173},
		{"id":"532afe0b1afde363","type":"text","text":"镜头驱动","x":2280,"y":-505,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"90fc5d5e7c42d0a5","type":"text","text":"镜头的接口类型\n","x":2620,"y":-500,"width":202,"height":55,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"7130581148f7d8eb","type":"text","text":"数字并行接口（DVP）","x":2940,"y":-380,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d79e7438f155add8","type":"text","text":"并行接口，线多、速率低一些、时序直观、调试相对简单","x":3280,"y":-418,"width":279,"height":76},
		{"id":"0f08536938d1f47b","type":"text","text":"数据线：`D0~D7`，8 根；也有 10bit、12bit\n时钟：`PCLK`，1 根\n同步：`HSYNC`，1 根\n同步：`VSYNC`，1 根\n`DE`，那就再加 1 根","x":3220,"y":-300,"width":473,"height":165},
		{"id":"a88ce36658f30d5d","type":"text","text":"MIPI CSI-2","x":2970,"y":-800,"width":160,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fe5f92cca595eb15","type":"text","text":"高速串行差分接口，线少、带宽高、抗干扰更好，但联调更难","x":3310,"y":-880,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"902b38d36cf8e36e","x":3310,"y":-789,"width":388,"height":184,"type":"text","text":"`1 对时钟` = 2 根\n`N 对数据 lane` = `2N 根`\n- `1-lane MIPI`：`2 + 2 = 4 根`\n- `2-lane MIPI`：`2 + 4 = 6 根`\n- `4-lane MIPI`：`2 + 8 = 10 根`\n\n\n\n"},
		{"id":"9b9d008a5870a7b4","x":2880,"y":-1360,"width":400,"height":330,"type":"file","file":"音视频开发/source_video_development/0c06b02f6bf1f1e231029b8b83021d82.png"}
	],
